    "formContent": "<div class=\"ielts-form-container\"><div class=\"form-section\"><div class=\"form-title\" style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:700;font-size:1.1em;margin-bottom:8px;\">Challenges facing the cruise ship industry</div><p style=\"font-weight:700;\">Problems with overtourism</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"31\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> is one of the worst problems.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; A tourist <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"32\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> is being introduced in some cities to reduce numbers, e.g. Barcelona.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Bruges: action was taken to limit day trips from the nearby port because the city was becoming a &lsquo;theme park&rsquo; (e.g. many shops were only stocking <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"33\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> and souvenirs).</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Dubrovnik: limits the number of tourists by managing the <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"34\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> of cruise ship arrivals.</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Problems of perception</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Cruises are generally associated with the elderly.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; There is an assumption about the <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"35\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> of cruises.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; People think there may be too many <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"36\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> .</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Solutions</p><p>Cruise lines are attracting younger customers by:</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; becoming more sustainable e.g. using hybrid engines.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; having a wide range of activities e.g. boxing, <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"37\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> and well-being programmes.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; offering a diverse selection of food including <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"38\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> options.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; providing reliable <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"39\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> .</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; improving marketing on social media with high quality <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"40\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> .</p></div></div>",
